【Camera】: Handheld-stabilized, low angle, aggressive dolly-in. Motion-blur streaks on every cut. Two frames of hard black between shots.</textarea></div><div class="pointer-events-none invisible absolute top-0 left-0 wrap-break-word whitespace-pre-wrap" aria-hidden="true"></div></div></div><div class="form-control space-y-2"><div class="flex flex-row items-center space-x-1"><label class="text-content-strong font-normal font-sans text-sm peer-disabled:cursor-not-allowed peer-disabled:opacity-70" for="model-input-resolution"><span class="label-text">Resolution</span></label><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" width="24" height="24" color="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" role="img" class="icon-sm cursor-pointer text-content-lighter" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed"><path stroke-linecap="square" d="M11 11h1v5m0-8.5V8m9 4a9 9 0 1 1-18 0 9 9 0 0 1 18 0Z"></path></svg></div><button type="button" role="combobox" aria-expanded="false" aria-autocomplete="none" dir="ltr" data-state="closed" class="flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-1 rounded-sm border border-stroke-strong hover:border-stroke-stronger font-semibold transition-colors placeholder:text-content-lighter focus-ring disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;&gt;span]:min-w-0 [&amp;&gt;span]:flex-1 [&amp;&gt;span]:truncate [&amp;&gt;span]:text-left bg-surface-raised text-content-base hover:bg-surface-alpha [&amp;[data-state=open]:not([data-disabled])]:border-stroke-stronger [&amp;[data-state=open]:not([data-disabled])]:bg-surface-alpha [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-content-control-muted h-10 px-3 py-1.5 text-sm max-w-full sm:min-w-fit" id="model-input-resolution" style="width:10rem"><span style="pointer-events:none">720p</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" role="img" class="size-4 shrink-0"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-li