}</code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="flex items-center p-4 pt-4 text-sm text-content-light"><div class="flex flex-col items-start space-y-3"><div><p>For 480p, your request will cost roughly <strong>$0.2205</strong> per second of generated video, for 720p, you will be charged roughly <strong>$0.4730</strong> per second of generated video, and for 1080p, roughly <strong>$1.164</strong> per second of generated video. Your request will cost <strong>$0.0214</strong> per 1000 tokens for 480p and 720p video and roughly <strong>$0.0234</strong> per 1000 tokens for 1080p. The number of tokens is roughly given by (height of output video * width of output video * (input video duration + output video duration) * 24) / 1024.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><!--$?--><template id="B:4"></template><!--/$--></div><script>$RC("B:3","S:3")</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"78:I[773514,[\"/_next/static/chunks/35d28u6wlsyd7.js?dpl=fcf5011503b58a41efb37-production\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0ljoon7bjcxsl.js?dpl=fcf5011503b58a41efb37-production\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3bf0_c9l7gpst.js?dpl=fcf5011503b58a41efb37-production\",\"/_next/static/chunks/2axxrzxfyhn9d.js?dpl=fcf5011503b58a41efb37-production\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07w_mi4cub-e-.js?dpl=fcf5011503b58a41efb37-production\",\"/_next/static/chunks/11rp8tulyszkx.js?dpl=fcf5011503b58a41efb37-production\",\"/_next/static/chunks/1v6t66c4z020d.js?dpl=fcf5011503b58a41efb37-production\",\"/_next/static/chunks/1_2wsujdk7xbv.js?dpl=fcf5011503b58a41efb37-production\",\"/_next/static/chunks/2-sdfz3venipx.js?dpl=fcf5011503b58a41efb37-production\",\"/_next/static/chunks/1mp45tcmxocyl.js?dpl=fcf5011503b58a41efb37-production\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3rhzbo_bpw3b_.js?dpl=fcf5011503b58a41efb37-production\",\"/_next/static/chunks/33ttxqe47y-5i.js?dpl=fcf5011503b58a41efb37-production\",\"/_next/static/chunks/273tktzs4uoc0.js?dpl=fcf5011503b58a41efb37-production\",\"/_next/static/chunks/1jodta3cxct1h.js?dpl=fcf5011503b5